  "test_text": "The final-test protocol was frozen before reserved-pixel acquisition. It evaluates all six arms and seeds 42, 43 and 44 using validation-selected best checkpoints, with adaptive-minus-within-class-shuffled patch macro-F1 as the primary contrast. The seven reserved patients cover 13 source slides (about 7.53 GiB). Model hashes are frozen before acquisition. No tuning follows test access. Current stage: waiting for within-class controls. No final-test scores are available in this snapshot.",
